                "text": "The bipartisan HOPE Act will extend the ACA tax credits and give hope to Jersey families struggling with the cost crisis.\u00a0\n\nWhether it\u2019s this solution to the health care crisis or another, failure is not an option.\nhttps://t.co/nP8SqmLoVB",
